          "settings": {
            "group_label": "",
            "question": "Will it work on my type of eye bags?",
            "answer": "<p>CEBEAM is designed to address both fluid-based puffiness and volume loss beneath the eye, helping improve the appearance of different types of eye bags.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "faq_item-2": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "group_label": "",
            "question": "How quickly will I notice a difference?",
            "answer": "<p>Some women notice the under-eye area looks fresher or less puffy the next morning. More visible changes typically develop with consistent twice-weekly use over the following weeks.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "faq_item-3": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "group_label": "",
            "question": "Does it hurt?",
            "answer": "<p>You may feel a light tingling sensation for a few seconds when the patches are first applied. Once that passes, you shouldn't feel them while you sleep.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "faq_item-4": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "group_label": "",
            "question": "Is it safe near the eye area?",
            "answer": "<p>The dissolving cones are designed specifically for the delicate under-eye area. Follow the application instructions and avoid applying the patches to irritated or damaged skin.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        }
